{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.QBetaC3HopfThreeFoldMarkov","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.QBetaC3HopfThreeFoldMarkov","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.q_beta_c3_hopf_three_fold_markov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.q_beta_c3_hopf_three_fold_markov","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-beta-c3-hopf-three-fold-markov.lean#L89-L103","doc":"**$Q_\\beta$ precision-ladder $c_3$ structural derivation.** Under\nthe `ThreeFoldMarkovHopfExtraction` class, the canonical `c_3`\ncoefficient (carried by the class as a field) equals the\nclassical-limit Jones polynomial of the Hopf link, `J_Hopf(q=1)`.\nThis identifies the PR #655 categorical chain's `c_3` with a\ntopological invariant (Hopf-link Jones at q=1) via the 3-fold\nMarkov closure containing Hopf substructure.\n\nThe class's substantive content (`c_3 = -2`) plus the closed-form\nclassical Jones value (`jonesHopf 1 = -2`) compose to the export\nidentity `c_3 = jonesHopf 1`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:q-beta-c3-hopf-three-fold-markov","label":"prop:q-beta-c3-hopf-three-fold-markov","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-beta-c3-hopf-three-fold-markov.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeFoldMarkovHopfExtraction.c_3_eq_neg_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeFoldMarkovHopfExtraction.c_3_eq_neg_two","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-beta-c3-hopf-three-fold-markov.lean#L79-L79","doc":"The substantive identification: `c_3 = -2`, i.e. the Hopf-link\nclassical-limit Jones value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeFoldMarkovHopfExtraction.c_3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeFoldMarkovHopfExtraction.c_3","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-beta-c3-hopf-three-fold-markov.lean#L76-L76","doc":"The `c_3` coefficient produced by the 3-fold Markov closure\n→ 2-strand sub-braid → Hopf substructure chain. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeFoldMarkovHopfExtraction.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeFoldMarkovHopfExtraction.mk","kind":"ctor","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-beta-c3-hopf-three-fold-markov.lean#L73-L73","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeFoldMarkovHopfExtraction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeFoldMarkovHopfExtraction","kind":"class","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-beta-c3-hopf-three-fold-markov.lean#L64-L79","doc":"**3-fold Markov closure → Hopf-link substructure axiomatisation**\nvia the explicit-residual pattern. The class carries the\ncoefficient `c_3` produced by the categorical chain as an\nexplicit scalar field, and asserts it equals the classical-limit\nHopf-link Jones value `J_Hopf(q=1) = -2`. This is substantive\ncontent: per-instance discharge requires identifying that the\nthird-order coefficient in the perturbative τ_M expansion\nfactors through 2-strand sub-braid Markov closures (each a\nHopf link). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jones_hopf_at_q_eq_one_eq_neg_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jones_hopf_at_q_eq_one_eq_neg_two","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-beta-c3-hopf-three-fold-markov.lean#L46-L51","doc":"At q=1 (the classical / Kazhdan-Lusztig decategorification limit per\nAGENTS.md §7b), the Hopf-link Jones polynomial equals -2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jonesHopf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jonesHopf","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-beta-c3-hopf-three-fold-markov.lean#L41-L42","doc":"The Jones polynomial of the Hopf link in q. ","signatureChunk":0}]}